 336  4277              ; here: -> A = the slot ID of page 1, where INIT runs: the primary slot from
 337  4277              ; port $A8 and, if EXPTBL says it is expanded, the secondary from the
 338  4277              ; slot's own register. The interrupts must be off. Uses A, BC, HL
