 356  4290              ; setpage2: A = a slot ID -> page 2 shows that slot: its primary slot in
 357  4290              ; port $A8 and, for an expanded slot, its secondary slot in the slot's
 358  4290              ; register, written at $FFFF through page 3 and copied into SLTTBL for the
 359  4290              ; BIOS. The interrupts must be off. Uses A, BC, DE, HL
