1405  B700              ; bshow, bank 1's: its pairs at the shift, 22 patterns from 1, with OTIR;
1406  B700              ; and when fresh says the bank is new, their colours. Uses A, BC, HL
1407  B700              bshow1: VRAM_WRITE $0008        ; 40  pair 1's pattern, the first
1407  B700 3E 08       >        ld a, low ($0008)
1407  B702 D3 99       >        out (VDP_CTRL), a
1407  B704 3E 40       >        ld a, high ($0008) | $40
1407  B706 D3 99       >        out (VDP_CTRL), a
