3578  B71D B7                   or a                    ;  5
3579  B71E C8                   ret z                   ; 12, or 6  the same bank as before
3580  B71F AF                   xor a                   ;  5
3581  B720 32 10 C1             ld (fresh), a           ; 14  sent once
